  "notes": "Owner-supplied brand artwork, same source and same rights basis as design-mark.svg. This variant keeps the full lockup (monogram plus the DESIGN-LAB / 设计实验室 wordmark), so it is the asset for slots wide enough to carry text; the small tiles use design-mark.svg because the wordmark is illegible below roughly 32px. The wordmark is outlined paths, not live text, so shipping it adds no font dependency and does not conflict with the pack rule against loading third-party remote fonts."
}
